{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_28", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_28.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Be quiet\u2014I think I hear someone in the hall.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "See who it is, Petra.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra (opening the door).", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, it's you, Captain Horster!", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Do come in.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster (coming in).", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Good morning.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "I thought I would just come in and see how you were.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (shaking his hand).", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Thanks\u2014that is really kind of you.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "And thank you, too, for helping us through the crowd, Captain Horster.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "How did you manage to get home again?", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, somehow or other.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "I am fairly strong, and there is more sound than fury about these folk.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, isn't their swinish cowardice astonishing?", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Look here, I will show you something!", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "There are all the stones they have thrown through my windows.", "para": 7, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Just look at them!", "para": 7, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "I'm hanged if there are more than two decently large bits of hard stone in the whole heap; the rest are nothing but gravel\u2014wretched little things.", "para": 7, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "And yet they stood out there bawling and swearing that they would do me some violence; but as for doing anything\u2014you don't see much of that in this town.", "para": 7, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Just as well for you this time, doctor!", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "True enough.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "But it makes one angry all the same; because if some day it should be a question of a national fight in real earnest, you will see that public opinion will be in favour of taking to one's heels, and the compact majority will turn tail like a flock of sheep, Captain Horster.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "That is what is so mournful to think of; it gives me so much concern, that\u2014.", "para": 9, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "No, devil take it, it is ridiculous to care about it!", "para": 9, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "They have called me an enemy of the people, so an enemy of the people let me be!", "para": 9, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "You will never be that, Thomas.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Don't swear to that, Katherine.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "To be called an ugly name may have the same effect as a pin-scratch in the lung.", "para": 11, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "And that hateful name\u2014I can't get quit of it.", "para": 11, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "It is sticking here in the pit of my stomach, eating into me like a corrosive acid.", "para": 11, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "And no magnesia will remove it.", "para": 11, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Bah!\u2014you should only laugh at them, father,", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "They will change their minds some day, Doctor.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, Thomas, as sure as you are standing here.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Perhaps, when it is too late.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Much good may it do them!", "para": 15, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "They may wallow in their filth then and rue the day when they drove a patriot into exile.", "para": 15, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "When do you sail, Captain Horster?", "para": 15, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Hm!\u2014that was just what I had come to speak about\u2014", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Why, has anything gone wrong with the ship?", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "No; but what has happened is that I am not to sail in it.", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you mean that you have been dismissed from your command?", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster (smiling).", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, that's just it.", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "You too.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "There, you see, Thomas!", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "And that for the truth's sake!", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, if I had thought such a thing possible\u2014", "para": 23, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "You mustn't take it to heart; I shall be sure to find a job with some ship-owner or other, elsewhere.", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "And that is this man Vik\u2014a wealthy man, independent of everyone and everything\u2014!", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Shame on him!", "para": 25, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "He is quite an excellent fellow otherwise; he told me himself he would willingly have kept me on, if only he had dared\u2014", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "But he didn't dare?", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "No, of course not.", "para": 27, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "It is not such an easy matter, he said, for a party man\u2014", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "The worthy man spoke the truth.", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "A party is like a sausage machine; it mashes up all sorts of heads together into the same mincemeat\u2014fatheads and blockheads, all in one mash!", "para": 29, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Come, come, Thomas dear!", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra (to HORSTER).", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "If only you had not come home with us, things might not have come to this pass.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "I do not regret it.", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra (holding out her hand to him).", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Thank you for that!", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster (to DR. STOCKMANN).", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "And so what I came to say was that if you are determined to go away, I have thought of another plan\u2014", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "That's splendid!\u2014if only we can get away at once.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "Hush!\u2014wasn't that some one knocking?", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "That is uncle, surely.", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Aha!", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "(Calls out.)", "para": 38, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Come in!", "para": 38, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Dear Thomas, promise me definitely\u2014.", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "(PETER STOCKMANN comes in from the hall.)", "para": 39, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, you are engaged.", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "In that case, I will\u2014", "para": 40, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "No, no, come in.", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "But I wanted to speak to you alone.", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "We will go into the sitting-room in the meanwhile.", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 117, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 118, "kind": "action", "text": "And I will look in again later.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}]}